  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Low-Income Housing Finance Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Financiamiento de la Vivienda Social</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo especfico para esta operacin es aumentar el acceso a crdito hipotecario a hogares con trabajadores con capacidad de pago para la adquisicin de vivienda. El logro de este objetivo favorecer al objetivo general de contribuir a la reduccin del dficit habitacional en El Salvador mediante la provisin de crditos hipotecarios para la adquisicin de vivienda de inters social a hogares con ingresos de hasta cuatro Salarios Mnimos Mensuales Vigentes (SMMV).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The specific objective of this operation is to increase housing financing to households with low-income workers for housing acquisition. The successful achievement of this objective will allow the general objective to reduce housing deficit in El Salvador through the provision of housing financing for the acquisition of social housing to households with the ability to pay up to four times the Actual Monthly Minimum Wage.</narrative>
  </description>
